# Design system

Sparse personal-site aesthetic (kdrag0n / kognise). Do not add heavy gradients, dark themes, or decorative chrome unless asked.

## Layout

- **Shell**: `.site-shell` (40rem) for text pages; `.site-shell-wide` (56rem) for gallery
- **Sections**: `text-xl font-bold` h2, generous `mt-16` spacing
- **Hero**: name as h1, headline + bio below, muted bio color

## Typography & links

- Font: JetBrains Mono via layout (`font-mono`)
- Links: `.ink-link` — underline, invert to black bg on hover
- Muted text: `text-muted-foreground`

## Components (reuse, don't duplicate)

| Component | Use |
|-----------|-----|
| `HomeView` | Homepage sections |
| `GalleryMosaic` | Gallery grid (`compact` on home) |
| `TimelineList` | History rows |
| `BlogPostList` | Writing index rows |
| `PeopleView` / `GratitudeView` | Gratitude list + person MDX |
| `MdxArticle` | Blog, people, and trust pages (about / contact / privacy) |
| `FadeIn` | Page enter animation (GSAP) |
| `Tip` | Hover tips on links |

## Homepage section order

Intro → What I'm working on → Essays → History → Daily → Gallery → Gratitude → Reach out

## Gallery

Mosaic with `feature` / `tall` / `wide` tiles. Hover shows title gradient. Keep images from `content/gallery.md`.

## Don't

- Hardcode copy in JSX when it belongs in `content/`
- Add new font families without explicit request
- Break mobile: test narrow column + gallery 2-col grid
